[0.012, "o", "Proposal 1 (rollback, pending) by gym-solver-propose-rollback (agent)\r\nExpires in 3586s.\r\n\r\nRoll default/web back from its previous spec to its previous spec.\r\nTouches 1 app on 1 node (gym-1); replaces 1 instance.\r\nServes the service web.default.\r\nUndo: `relish undo 1` puts web back on its previous spec.\r\n\r\nReversibility: exact. Undo: relish undo 1 (puts web back on its previous spec).\r\n\r\nBlast radius:\r\n  apps: default/web\r\n  nodes: gym-1\r\n  instances: 1 replaced, 0 started, 0 stopped\r\n  services: web.default\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n  default/web command: (none) -> [\"--mode\",\"healthy\",\"--port\",\"29404\"]\r\n  default/web env.VERSION: v2 -> v1\r\n  default/web exec: (none) -> /Users/miko/github/rb-wt/target-tag-028/debug/testapp\r\n  default/web script: echo \"web v2: starting\"\r\nsleep 5\r\necho \"web v2: fatal: DATABASE_URL is not set\" >&2\r\nexit 1\r\n -> (none)\r\n\r\nThe agent's reason (its own words, unverified):\r\n  The deploy at 08:49:43Z put web on v2, which exits on startup with 'fatal: DATABASE_URL is not set' and has restarted 4+ t"]
